UTRK3390 TITLE 'IEC0SCR1 3390 support'                                  00010038
UTRK3390 CSECT ,                                                        00020038
*********************************************************************** 00030038
*<TRKCALC 3390>                                                         00040038
*********************************************************************** 00050038
*                                                                       00060038
*  Function:  IBM TRKCALC macro support for 3390 devices                00070038
*             called by UTRKCALC usermod (which is invoked by           00080038
*             a zap to IBM's IEC0SCR1 CSECT, part of IGC018 LMOD).      00090038
*                                                                       00100038
*  Device attributes:   see IECZDTAB CSECT (part of Stage2 sysgen)      00110038
*             The 3390 device allocates space on a track in             00120038
*             multiples of cells, which are 34 bytes in length.         00130038
*             See the Formulas section for how this happens.            00140038
*                                                                       00150038
*  Only usable regs:  R0, R1, R9, R10, R11, R14, R15                    00160038
*  We're not allowed to touch the other regs                            00170038
*                                                                       00180038
*        Entry                     Usage (see Notation below)           00190038
*        ------------------------- ------------------------------------ 00200038
*        R0        scratch         Kb;CDb (usually)                     00210038
*        R1  ->    STAR parmlist   unchanged                            00220038
*        R9  ->    DVCT entry      DVCT ignored; usually contains Rb    00230038
*        R10       scratch         scratch                              00240038
*        R11       scratch         scratch                              00250038
*        R14 ->    return address  unchanged                            00260038
*        R15 ->    UTRKCALC        unchanged                            00270038
*                                                                       00280038
*  Notes:                                                               00290038
*                                                                       00300038
*        R0 is partitioned to contain                                   00310038
*           Kb  in bits  0:11,                                          00320038
*           CDb in bits 12:31.                                          00330038
*           Bitwise R0: kkkk.kkkk.kkkk.dddd.dddd.dddd.dddd.dddd         00340038
*        This works out OK (or should) since 0 <= KL < 256, and         00350038
*        the largest possible Kb = 612 = x'264'; while                  00360038
*        0 <= DL < 65536, hence the largest possible CDb is             00370038
*        67898 = x'1093A'.  Yes, x'FFFF' is a larger record than        00380038
*        can be written on a 3390 track, but the caller can pass        00390038
*        that value, so we try to deal with it.  This might not seem    00400038
*        very significant, but this code is *very* short of usable      00410038
*        registers.  As it turns out, we don't need CDb from R0,        00420038
*        but it's nice to have around for maintenance.                  00430038
*                                                                       00440038
*        We ignore the DVCT pointer since we're so short on regs,       00450038
*        and instead of fetching values from the DVCT, we just          00460038
*        use local values.  Kinda cheating, but avoids all that         00470038
*        ugly "resetting base reg" nonsense.                            00480038
*                                                                       00490038
*        A driver for testing UTRK3390 may be generated by              00500038
*        specifying 'SYSPARM(TEST)' as a parm to the assembler.         00510038
*                                                                       00520038
*  Notation:                                                            00530038
*        C     Count cells = 10                                         00540038
*        Cb    Bytes consumed by Count (cell integral) = 10 * 34        00550038
*        KL    Key length                                               00560038
*        KN    (KL + 6) / 232, rounded up; cells                        00570038
*        K     9 + ( (KL + (KN * 6) + 6) / 34), rounded up; cells       00580038
*        DL    Data length                                              00590038
*        Kb    Bytes consumed by Key (cell integral) = K * 34           00600038
*        Db    Bytes consumed by Data (cell integral) = D * 34          00610038
*        CDb   Bytes consumed by Count + Data = Cb + Db                 00620038
*        Rb    Bytes consumed by Count + Key + Data = Cb + Kb + Db      00630038
*        Tb    Bytes available for use on track = 57876                 00640038
*              (when standard IBM R0 is present on track)               00650038
*        TBb   Bytes remaining on track (track balance)                 00660038
*                                                                       00670038
*  Formulas:                                                            00680038
*        Each record on a 3390 (Count, ÝKey,¨ Data) is allocated        00690038
*        as follows (units represent cells):                            00700038
*                                                                       00710038
*        Record cells = C + K + D                                       00720038
*                                                                       00730038
*        Count = 10 cells = 340 bytes                                   00740038
*                                                                       00750038
*        KN = (KL + 6) / 232, round up to integer                       00760038
*        K = 0 when no key is present, else                             00770038
*        K = 9 + ((KL + (6 *KN) + 6) / 34), round up to integer         00780038
*                                                                       00790038
*        DN = (DL + 6) / 232, round up to integer                       00800038
*        D = 9 + ((DL + (6 * DN) + 6) / 34), round up to integer        00810038
*                                                                       00820038
*  The count area contains 8 bytes that identify the location           00830038
*  of the record by cylinder, head, and record number.  The count       00840038
*  record also specifies the key length (zero when not present),        00850038
*  and the data record length.                                          00860038
*                                                                       00870038
*  An IBM Standard R0 (record zero) is assumed to be present on         00880038
*  each track.  When this record is present on the track, there         00890038
*  are 1729 cells; without it, there are 1749 cells.  The IBM           00900038
*  Standard R0 is also called a track descriptor record, or a           00910038
*  capacity record.                                                     00920038
*                                                                       00930038
*  Data records begin with Record 1.                                    00940038
*                                                                       00950038
*  An EOF record consumes 20 cells.                                     00960038
*                                                                       00970038
*  Track Balance represents the amount of free space remaining          00980038
*  on a partially written track.                                        00990038
*                                                                       01000038
*        ¦<--already-written---------->¦<--free-space-->¦               01010038
*        +-----------------------------+----------------+               01020038
*        ¦      Data                   ¦ Track Balance  ¦               01030038
*        +-----------------------------+----------------+               01040038
*        ¦<----------------3390-track------------------>¦               01050038
*                                                                       01060038
*********************************************************************** 01070038
         EJECT ,                                                        01080038
R0       EQU   0                                                        01090038
R1       EQU   1                                                        01100038
R9       EQU   9                                                        01110038
R10      EQU   10                                                       01120038
R11      EQU   11                                                       01130038
R14      EQU   14                                                       01140038
R15      EQU   15                                                       01150038
         USING UTRK3390,R15                                             01160038
         USING STAR,R1                                                  01170038
*********************************************************************** 01180038
*  Validate 3390s are generated in the system                           01190038
*********************************************************************** 01200038
         L     R10,CVTPTR              @ CVT                            01210038
         L     R10,CVTZDTAB-CVT(,R10)  @ IECZDTAB   (CVTZDTAB)          01220038
         SLR   R11,R11                                                  01230038
         IC    R11,15(,R10)       index for 3390s                       01240038
         LTR   R11,R11            valid?                                01250038
         BZ    NO3390             no, bail                              01260038
*********************************************************************** 01270038
*  Calculate number of bytes occupied by Count, ÝKey,¨ Data             01280038
*********************************************************************** 01290038
         SLR   R0,R0              R0 becomes Kb;CDb                     01300038
*                                                                       01310038
*  Compute number of bytes occupied by Key portion of record            01320038
*                                                                       01330038
CALCKEY  DS    0H                                                       01340038
         CLI   STARKL,0           key specified?                        01350038
         BE    CALCDATA           no, skip to calc data                 01360038
*                                                                       01370038
         SLR   R11,R11                                                  01380038
         ICM   R11,1,STARKL       KL                                    01390038
         LA    R11,6(,R11)        KL + 6                                01400038
         SLR   R10,R10                                                  01410038
         D     R10,=F'232'        (KL + 6) / 232 = KN                   01420038
         LTR   R10,R10            remainder?                            01430038
         BZ    *+8                no, skip rounding up                  01440038
         LA    R11,1(,R11)        round KN up                           01450038
         M     R10,=F'6'          R11 = KN * 6                          01460038
         LA    R11,6(,R11)        R11 = (KN * 6) + 6                    01470038
         SLR   R10,R10                                                  01480038
         IC    R10,STARKL                                               01490038
         AR    R11,R10            R11 = KL + (KN*6) + 6                 01500038
         SLR   R10,R10                                                  01510038
         D     R10,=F'34'         R11 = (KL+(KN*6)+6)/34 = K - 9        01520038
         LTR   R10,R10            remainder?                            01530038
         BZ    *+8                no, skip rounding up                  01540038
         LA    R11,1(,R11)        round (K - 9) up                      01550038
         LA    R11,9(,R11)        R11 + 9 = K                           01560038
         M     R10,=F'34'         R11 = K * 34 = Kb                     01570038
         LR    R0,R11             R0 = 00.00.Kb.Kb                      01580038
*                                                                       01590038
*  Compute number of bytes occupied by Count + Data portion of record   01600038
*                                                                       01610038
CALCDATA DS    0H                                                       01620038
         SLR   R11,R11                                                  01630038
         ICM   R11,3,STARDL       R11 = DL                              01640038
         A     R11,=F'6'          R11 = DL + 6                          01650038
         SLR   R10,R10                                                  01660038
         D     R10,=F'232'        R11 = (DL+6)/232 = DN                 01670038
         LTR   R10,R10            remainder?                            01680038
         BZ    *+8                                                      01690038
         LA    R11,1(,R11)        round DN up                           01700038
         M     R10,=F'6'          R11 = DN * 6                          01710038
         LA    R11,6(,R11)        R11 = (DN*6) + 6                      01720038
         SLR   R10,R10                                                  01730038
         ICM   R10,3,STARDL                                             01740038
         AR    R11,R10            R11 = DL + (DN*6) + 6                 01750038
         SLR   R10,R10                                                  01760038
         D     R10,=F'34'         R11 = (DL+(DN*6)+6)/34 = D - 9        01770038
         LTR   R10,R10            remainder?                            01780038
         BZ    *+8                                                      01790038
         LA    R11,1(,R11)        round (D - 9) up                      01800038
         LA    R11,9(,R11)        R11 + 9 = D                           01810038
         M     R10,=F'34'         R11 = D * 34 = Db                     01820038
*                                                                       01830038
         A     R11,=A(10*34)      add Count bytes (10 cells)            01840038
*                                 R11 = CDb                             01850038
*                                                                       01860038
*  Preserve a copy of Count + ÝKey +¨ Data bytes in R9                  01870038
*                                                                       01880038
         LR    R9,R0              R9 = 00.00.Kb.Kb                      01890038
         AR    R9,R11             R9 = Rb = Cb + Kb + Db                01900038
*                                                                       01910038
*  Preserve a copy of Kb;CDb in R0                                      01920038
*                                                                       01930038
         SLL   R0,16+4                                                  01940038
         OR    R0,R11             R0(0:11)=Kb;R0(12:31)=CDb             01950038
         AIF   ('&SYSPARM' NE 'TEST').NOSAVR0                           01960038
         STCM  R0,15,ZKBCDB       <debug> R0(0:11)=Kb;R0(12:31)=CDb     01970038
.NOSAVR0 ANOP                                                           01980038
         EJECT ,                                                        01990038
*********************************************************************** 02000038
*  Calculate track balance or use value user provided in STARBAL        02010038
*********************************************************************** 02020038
CALCTBAL DS    0H                                                       02030038
         CLI   STARR,1            star Record=1?                        02040038
         BNE   CTBN1              no, br                                02050038
*                                                                       02060038
*  Calc trkbal: r=1                                                     02070038
*                                                                       02080038
         L     R11,=A(1729*34)    3390 track length w/ standard IBM R0  02090038
         STCM  R11,3,STARBAL      return full track length to caller    02100038
         TM    STARFLGS,STARREMV  REMOVE=YES?                           02110038
         BNO   CKFUNCTN           deal with REMOVE=NO later             02120038
*                                                                       02130038
         LR    R0,R11             return track length to caller         02140038
         SLR   R15,R15            return code = 0                       02150038
         BR    R14                return to caller                      02160038
*---------------------------------------------------------------------- 02170038
*                                                                       02180038
*  Calc trkbal: not r=1                                                 02190038
*                                                                       02200038
CTBN1    DS    0H                 not star r=1                          02210038
         TM    STARFLGS,STARUBAL  caller provided us with balance?      02220038
         BO    CKFUNCTN           yes, use it; br                       02230038
*                                                                       02240038
*  Caller didn't provide track balance, calculate it for STARR recs     02250038
*                                                                       02260038
         SLR   R11,R11                                                  02270038
         IC    R11,STARR          caller-provided R#                    02280038
         TM    STARFLGS,STARREMV  REMOVE=YES?                           02290038
         BO    *+6                yes; br                               02300038
         BCTR  R11,0              R# - 1                                02310038
         MR    R10,R9             R11 = bytes used by records           02320038
         L     R10,=A(1729*34)    track length -                        02330038
         SR    R10,R11            used bytes = track balance            02340038
         STCM  R10,3,STARBAL      return track balance to caller        02350038
         EJECT ,                                                        02360038
*********************************************************************** 02370038
*  Check which TRKCALC FUNCTN= was specified                            02380038
*********************************************************************** 02390038
CKFUNCTN DS    0H                                                       02400038
         SLR   R11,R11                                                  02410038
         ICM   R11,3,STARBAL      R11 = track balance                   02420038
         TM    STARFLGS,STARFUNC  FUNCTN=TRKCAP?                        02430038
         BNO   TRKBAL             no, FUNCTN=TRKBAL; br                 02440038
         SPACE 3                                                        02450038
*********************************************************************** 02460038
*  TRKCALC FUNCTN=TRKCAP                                                02470038
*  Returns R0 = # fixed length records that will fit on track balance   02480038
*********************************************************************** 02490038
TRKCAP   DS    0H                                                       02500038
         SLR   R10,R10                                                  02510038
         DR    R10,R9             R11 = recs that fit in TBb            02520038
         LTR   R0,R11             how many was that?                    02530038
         BNP   TCNOFIT            none?  br                             02540038
*                                                                       02550038
TCFIT    DS    0H                                                       02560038
         SLR   R15,R15            TRKCAP rc=0                           02570038
         BR    R14                return to caller                      02580038
*---------------------------------------------------------------------- 02590038
TCNOFIT  DS    0H                                                       02600038
         SLR   R0,R0              can't fit any records in TBb          02610038
         LA    R15,4              trkcap rc=4                           02620038
         BR    R14                return to caller                      02630038
*---------------------------------------------------------------------- 02640038
         EJECT ,                                                        02650038
*********************************************************************** 02660038
*  TRKCALC FUNCTN=TRKBAL                                                02670038
*********************************************************************** 02680038
TRKBAL   DS    0H                                                       02690038
         TM    STARFLGS,STARREMV  REMOVE=YES specified?                 02700038
         BNO   TBLEAVE            no, leave record there; br            02710038
*                                                                       02720038
         AR    R11,R9             reclaim removed rec's space           02730038
         STCM  R11,3,STARBAL      return new balance to caller          02740038
         LR    R0,R11             return new balance to caller          02750038
         SLR   R15,R15            TRKBAL rc=0                           02760038
         BR    R14                                                      02770038
*---------------------------------------------------------------------- 02780038
TBLEAVE  DS    0H                                                       02790038
         CR    R11,R9             record fits within balance?           02800038
         BL    TBCKMAX                                                  02810038
*                                                                       02820038
         SR    R11,R9             fits, calc new balance                02830038
         STCM  R11,3,STARBAL      return new balance to caller          02840038
         LR    R0,R11             return new balance to caller          02850038
         SLR   R15,R15            TRKBAL rc=0                           02860038
         BR    R14                                                      02870038
*---------------------------------------------------------------------- 02880038
TBCKMAX  DS    0H                 record doesn't fit, check MAXSIZE     02890038
         TM    STARFLGS,STARMAXS  MAXSIZE=YES specified?                02900038
         BNO   TBNOFIT            no, br                                02910038
*                                                                       02920038
*  The record doesn't fit, but caller specified MAXSIZE=YES.            02930038
*                                                                       02940038
*  Calculate how much data will fit within track balance,               02950038
*  and return that to caller with rc=8.                                 02960038
*                                                                       02970038
*  Note that neither Count nor Key overhead is returned to caller       02980038
*  (in R0) although those values are considered in the calculation.     02990038
*  The value returned represents the number of bytes which the          03000038
*  caller may write in the remaining free space on the track,           03010038
*  and implicity includes 3390 overhead.                                03020038
*                                                                       03030038
*  STARBAL is not updated in this instance, since the caller may        03040038
*  not think too much of our suggestion and might need a good STARBAL.  03050038
*                                                                       03060038
         S     R11,=A(10*34)      R11 = TBb - Cb                        03070038
         BNP   TBNOFIT            no room for any data in TBb, br       03080038
         LR    R10,R0             R10 = Kb;CDb                          03090038
         SRL   R10,16+4           R10 = Kb                              03100038
         SR    R11,R10            R11 = TBb - Cb - Kb                   03110038
         BNP   TBNOFIT            no room for any data in TBb, br       03120038
         S     R11,=A(9*34)       need 9 cells for D overhead           03130038
         BNP   TBNOFIT            no room for any data in TBb, br       03140038
*                                                                       03150038
*  Round the remaining Free Space (R11) down to cell boundaries,        03160038
*  in case the caller is confused and gave us a wacky TRKBAL.           03170038
*                                                                       03180038
         SLR   R10,R10                                                  03190038
         D     R10,=F'34'         R11 = Space in cells                  03200038
         M     R10,=F'34'         R11 = Space in bytes                  03210038
*                                                                       03220038
*  Figure out how the remaining Free Space is partitioned between       03230038
*  Data and Overhead (OVH).  Free Space refers to the amount of         03240038
*  space in Track Balance, minus space needed for Count, Key,           03250038
*  and 6 bytes of fixed overhead for a data record.                     03260038
*                                                                       03270038
*        ¦<----------free-space------------------------>¦               03280038
*        +-----------------------------+----------+-----+               03290038
*        ¦      DL                     ¦  6 * DN  ¦  6  ¦               03300038
*        +-----------------------------+----------+-----+               03310038
*        ¦<------data----------------->¦<---overhead--->¦               03320038
*                                                                       03330038
*  Before we do anything, remove the 6 bytes of fixed overhead          03340038
*  from our consideration:                                              03350038
*                                                                       03360038
         S     R11,=F'6'          fixed overhead annoyance gone         03370038
         LR    R0,R11             save free space                       03380038
*                                                                       03390038
         EJECT ,                                                        03400038
*                                       DL + 6                          03410038
*  We know FreeSpace = DL + 6(DN); DN = ------ + R                      03420038
*                                         232                           03430038
*  R is the round-up factor: 0 <= R < 1                                 03440038
*                                                                       03450038
*       FS                                                              03460038
*  DN = --- + R                                                         03470038
*       238                                                             03480038
*                                                                       03490038
         SLR   R10,R10                                                  03500038
         D     R10,=F'238'        FS / 238                              03510038
         LTR   R10,R10            remainder?                            03520038
         BZ    *+8                no, skip rounding                     03530038
         LA    R11,1(,R11)        round DN up                           03540038
         M     R10,=F'6'          6 * DN                                03550038
*                                                                       03560038
*  DL = FS - 6DN                                                        03570038
*                                                                       03580038
         SR    R0,R11             how's the fit now?                    03590038
         BNP   TBNOFIT            no room for data in FreeSpace, br     03600038
*                                                                       03610038
         LA    R15,8              TRKBAL MAXSIZE=YES rc=8               03620038
         BR    R14                return to caller                      03630038
*---------------------------------------------------------------------- 03640038
TBNOFIT  DS    0H                 FUNCTN=TRBAL rec doesn't fit          03650038
         SLR   R0,R0              doesn't fit                           03660038
         LA    R15,4              TRKBAL rc=4                           03670038
         BR    R14                return to caller                      03680038
*---------------------------------------------------------------------- 03690038
NO3390   DS    0H                 no 3390s gen'd in system              03700038
         SLR   R0,R0                                                    03710038
         LA    R15,12             TRKBAL rc=12                          03720038
         BR    R14                return to caller                      03730038
*---------------------------------------------------------------------- 03740038
         EJECT ,                                                        03750038
*********************************************************************** 03760038
*  Data areas                                                           03770038
*********************************************************************** 03780038
         LTORG ,                                                        03790038
*                                                                       03800038
         PRINT DATA                                                     03810038
PATCH    DC    32S(*)                                                   03820038
*                                                                       03830038
         AIF   ('&SYSPARM' NE 'TEST').SKIPDRV                           03840038
         COPY QTRKCALC                 generate UTRK3390 test driver    03850038
.SKIPDRV ANOP                                                           03860038
         EJECT ,                                                        03870038
*********************************************************************** 03880038
*  DSECTs                                                               03890038
*********************************************************************** 03900038
         IHADVCT2 ,               MVS38j IHADVCT macro + modulo support 03910038
         EJECT ,                                                        03920038
STAR     DSECT ,                                                        03930038
         TRKCALC MF=D             TRKCALC parmlist (STAR)               03940038
*                                                                       03950038
         PUSH  PRINT                                                    03960038
         PRINT NOGEN                                                    03970038
         CVT   DSECT=YES                                                03980038
         POP   PRINT                                                    03990038
         END   ,                                                        04000038
